  "prefLabel": "Emab 202.07 Motions and Objections",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emab 202.07 Motions and Objections. Any request for action by the board shall be by motion. All motions and objections thereto, other than those made during a hearing, shall be made in writing. They shall state with particularity the grounds upon which they are made and shall set forth the relief or order sought.\n\nSource. #10394, eff 8-9-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emab200.html"
